flowchart LR
    U[User / Client] --> API[FastAPI Query Route]
    API --> C1{Retrieval Cache}
    C1 -->|hit| R[Ranked Context]
    C1 -->|miss| E[Offline E5 ONNX Embedder]
    E --> D[Dense HNSW / FAISS Runtime]
    API --> S[Sparse BM25S Retriever]
    S --> F[RRF Fusion\nBM25:HNSW = 2:1]
    D --> F
    F --> C1
    R --> G{generate?}
    G -->|false| X[Extractive Answer / OOD Abstention]
    G -->|true| C2{Response Cache}
    C2 -->|hit| A[Cached Grounded Answer]
    C2 -->|miss| L[Groq SLM with 0.2 s timeout]
    L --> A
    X --> RESP[Validated API Response]
    A --> RESP
    RESP --> U
    ART[Offline Artifact Bundle\nBM25, metadata, tokenizer, ONNX, HNSW, ground truth] --> API
